{"id":"612c45683cbbc89b","group":"68","path":"68/68-df-real-parameter-enumeration.md","title":"Enumeration by Real Parameters","display":"df-real-parameter-enumeration — Enumeration by Real Parameters","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-df-real-parameter-enumeration","aliases":["68-df-real-parameter-enumeration"],"display":"df-real-parameter-enumeration — Enumeration by Real Parameters","depends_on":["[[68-df-baire-space]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"§20 p.75 / PDF 84, definition before 20.1","verification_status":"source-adapted-definition","source_proof_status":"not-applicable-definition","revision_basis":"supplied-68-archive; local content and dependency review"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-df-real-parameter-enumeration"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-df-real-parameter-enumeration</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-real-parameter-enumeration — Enumeration by Real Parameters"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4bd688e6777d088c\" href=\"?note=4bd688e6777d088c\" title=\"68-df-baire-space\">68-df-baire-space</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§20 p.75 / PDF 84, definition before 20.1"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-adapted-definition"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-applicable-definition"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"supplied-68-archive; local content and dependency review"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m,k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m,k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B,X_{m,k}\">\\(\\mathcal B,X_{m,k}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4bd688e6777d088c\" href=\"?note=4bd688e6777d088c\" title=\"68-df-baire-space\">68-df-baire-space</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq X_{m+1,k}\">\\(Q\\subseteq X_{m+1,k}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X_{m,k})\">\\(\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X_{m,k})\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec\\alpha\\,^{\\frown}\\langle\\beta\\rangle\">\\(\\vec\\alpha\\,^{\\frown}\\langle\\beta\\rangle\\)</span> 表示在实输入末尾添加 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\\in\\mathcal B\">\\(\\beta\\in\\mathcal B\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{REnum}_{m,k}\">\\(\\operatorname{REnum}_{m,k}\\)</span> 为下式引入的谓词。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{REnum}_{m,k}(Q,\\mathcal C)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\forall A\\in\\mathcal C\\;\\exists\\beta\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\forall(\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x)\\in X_{m,k}\\;\\bigl((\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x)\\in A\\leftrightarrow(\\vec\\alpha\\,^{\\frown}\\langle\\beta\\rangle,\\vec x)\\in Q\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{REnum}_{m,k}(Q,\\mathcal C)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\forall A\\in\\mathcal C\\;\\exists\\beta\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\forall(\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x)\\in X_{m,k}\\;\\bigl((\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x)\\in A\\leftrightarrow(\\vec\\alpha\\,^{\\frown}\\langle\\beta\\rangle,\\vec x)\\in Q\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是原书 R-enumerates 的覆盖条件：类中的每个关系至少由一个实参数切片表示，不要求唯一参数，也不要求任意切片都属于所枚举类。20.1 中后者可由 Q 的层级额外推出。索引是实数，不能换成自然数枚举所有带实参数的关系。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-baire-space","status":"resolved","id":"4bd688e6777d088c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-baire-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-baire-space","status":"resolved","id":"4bd688e6777d088c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$m,k\\in\\mathbb N$，$\\mathcal B,X_{m,k}$ 见 [[68-df-baire-space]]。$Q\\subseteq X_{m+1,k}$，$\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X_{m,k})$，$\\vec\\alpha\\,^{\\frown}\\langle\\beta\\rangle$ 表示在实输入末尾添加 $\\beta\\in\\mathcal B$。$\\operatorname{REnum}_{m,k}$ 为下式引入的谓词。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"m,k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B,X_{m,k}","display":false},{"tex":"Q\\subseteq X_{m+1,k}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X_{m,k})","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec\\alpha\\,^{\\frown}\\langle\\beta\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta\\in\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{REnum}_{m,k}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{REnum}_{m,k}(Q,\\mathcal C)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\forall A\\in\\mathcal C\\;\\exists\\beta\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\forall(\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x)\\in X_{m,k}\\;\\bigl((\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x)\\in A\\leftrightarrow(\\vec\\alpha\\,^{\\frown}\\langle\\beta\\rangle,\\vec x)\\in Q\\bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":1560,"backlinks":[{"id":"cc4e938a01248a42","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$ 且 $n\\ge1$，$m,k\\in\\mathbb N$。无参数解析类及带实参数投射类见 [[68-df-projective-hierarchy]]；$\\operatorname{REnum}_{m,k}$ 见 [[68-df-real-parameter-enumeration]]。"},{"id":"f850298d5e806601","anchor":"ref-88","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-real-parameter-enumeration]]"},{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-71","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-real-parameter-enumeration]] — definition"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-118","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-real-parameter-enumeration|df-real-parameter-enumeration — Enumeration by Real Parameters]]"}],"outgoing":["4bd688e6777d088c"]}